Transport Modes:
----------------
1. `hybrid` (default):
   Control plane over SSH (`BatchMode=yes`), Wayland & Tray/Notification data
   plane over native kernel `AF_VSOCK` (`vhost-vsock`). Zero guest daemon setup.
2. `vsock` (alias: `socket`):
   100% `AF_VSOCK` control plane (JSON-RPC to guest `wayport-daemon`) and data
