3. `ssh`:
   100% SSH control plane + `ssh -R` Unix-socket Waypipe tunnel + SSH stdio
   System Tray / Notifications bridge. Requires no `vhost-vsock` (works with
   remote Linux hosts, containers, or VMs without Virtio VSOCK).
"""

